  "fingerprintAlgorithm": "sha256(lowercase-key-sorted-utf8-json)",
  "notes": "The lab owns the concrete machine and font-set fingerprint allow-lists. Strict 4K60 rendering evidence is valid only when every requiredPinnedField is recorded, referenceMatch=true, and the manifest rendering values match the suite-specific rendering contract. Upscaling is isolated on the production OpenGL 4.3+ and libmpv OpenGL path; its certification cannot reuse a D3D11/offscreen playback or danmaku certificate. HDR and VRR are disabled so Present cadence is evaluated against a fixed 60 Hz output rather than an adaptive display. The font cache is warmed by the named deterministic preparation before timed capture."
}
